flowchart TD
 SAVED["回答commit: delivery waiting + delivery_id + route"] --> LOCAL{"route.harness"}
 LOCAL -->|callbridge| CB["serverDeliveries → markSending"]
 CB --> SEND["CallBridgeDeliverer → callBridgeSender"]
 SEND -->|構造化: 通話未開設/未送信 directory_link_down| RETRY["deferServerDelivery: 30秒/回答後10分"]
 RETRY --> CB
 SEND -->|送信結果不明 / 再起動でsending| UNKNOWN["reportDelivery unknown: 自動再送しない"]
 SEND -->|送信前例外 / open拒否 / 明示delivery error| FAILED["reportDelivery failed: 自動再送しない"]
 RETRY -->|回答後10分超過| FAILED
 FAILED --> GET
 SEND -->|delivered| REPORT["reportDelivery → event updated"]
 LOCAL -->|通常channel| FETCH["daemon sync: GET deliveries"]
 FETCH --> PREP["saveAll添付 → journal sendingを先に永続化"]
 PREP --> ADAPTER["sendChannelAnswer: 既存channel / Codex Aiterm"]
 ADAPTER -->|submitted| SUCCESS["journal report delivered"]
 ADAPTER -->|queued| QUEUE["journal queued: 2秒ごとstate照合"]
 ADAPTER -->|unknown/failed| FAILURE["journal report unknown/failed"]
 QUEUE -->|emitted| SUCCESS
 QUEUE -->|unknown/withdrawn/closed| FAILURE
 SUCCESS --> RPT["POST deliveries/:id: 報告だけ再試行可"]
 FAILURE --> RPT
 RPT -->|失敗| KEEP["journal report保持 / 本文再送しない"]
 KEEP --> RPT
 RPT -->|受付| CLEAR["journal削除"]
 FETCH -->|resume/明示getでroute変更/待ち解消| WITHDRAW["未消費本文withdraw / 競合なら不明・再送しない"]
 UNKNOWN --> GET["get_decision / resume: 保存済み答え取得"]
 REPORT --> UI["SSE→画面再取得"]
